! * Full-page modal used in US. Excluded from AdGuard as we can't check if trusted filters are enabled to remove 'inert' attribute.
!   See https://github.com/Stevoisiak/Stevos-AI-Blocklist/issues/194 and https://github.com/AdguardTeam/AdguardForiOS/issues/2547
